Hello all,

Thanks for your help, but I finally find the cause.
Tru64 UNIX V4.x only supports narrow addessing for SCSI devices (so
with ID from 0 to 7), and my new disk was by default with SCSI ID 8.

After changing its ID to 1, it worked perfectly.
This is why it was detected during the 5.1A install or at poweron with
a ">>> show dev" but not with 4.0G (5.x supports SCSI ID > 7).

Thanks again,
Mike


