David Konerding <dek@compbio.berkeley.edu> wrote in message news:<slrnb7k7on.qv.dek@wuzzy.berkeley.edu>...
 
> The "info" pages, which are included with the gcc distribution, have
> a page on this, "Variable attributes" which explain how to specify the
