Hallo Kollegin! :-)

Is this a terminal server from Digital? If not you should try
to connect with a laptop. I use Compaq Pathworks to connect
via serial line. Before that I used the Hyperterminal.
If this works you have a misconfiguration in your terminal server.

Indeed you need the right cables. "Normal" console cables like
you use for your Cisco routers are not working. You need special
console cables and special adapters from western to the 9 pin connector.

bye
Reinhard

