Are you after disk usage (du) or file integrity (tripwire) or something 
else?

du will give you a disk usage of a particular path eg "du -ks 
/home/a_user" will spit that out in KB and you could place it in a 
script and do other stuff with the results as well as kicking it off 
from cron if you want regular updates.

tripwire is an open source integrity checker if you're wanting to 
monitor any changes to the file system at all.



